                      *NOTE* READ Additional Information!

Additional information:

This area is also roamed by the Lord of the Hunt, what I suggest is before
roaming this area, get a party of friends and kill him first, he takes 10
days to regen and you have free reign during that time.  Very good exp can
be had here, upwards of 300k/hr for my level 47 Warrior, but Terror Beasts
can be a bit annoying at times with their Fear spell.  Anyway, enjoy!

Asterix II
Lvl 47 Dwarf Warrior
